From 3ded88eb31a9b6a23f04eaf4b7f2a085a7eccb0a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mqsirrel <68720462+Mqsirrel@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 1 Sep 2026 23:13:46 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(theme): add palette picker, G guidance toggle, gradient
 bar and gallery
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Wire the seven-palette work into a full picker experience and keep the
derive-guidance gate consistent with the settings module:

- widgets: ThemeSwatch + ThemePickerModal (T opens; live preview on move,
  Enter keeps, Esc restores). Import PALETTES/mix/ramp.
- app: T -> action_open_theme_picker; G -> action_toggle_guidance;
  apply_theme(name, quiet) skips the toast for preview; console service
  guidance gated behind derive_guidance_enabled().
- parsers: derive_potential_and_next(..., enabled=None) per-call override;
  every parse fn threads derive_guidance; parse_scan_file forwards it.
- widgets AddServiceModal: default access potential blank ("— not rated —"),
  preset autofill suppressed unless guidance is enabled.
- MachineStatusStrip: rising gradient progress bar via mix()/ramp().
- dev/theme_gallery.py renders all palettes to dev/previews/theme-gallery.png.
- pyproject: add Pillow to dev deps.
- Tests: picker semantics, palette contrast/accessibility, guidance-gate
  console, per-call enabled override. 89 pass.

Co-authored-by: arena-agent <297053741+arena-agent@users.noreply.github.com>
